      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS FENDI (1) is a promising type who notched her 2nd career success when too good (21.84) at this track last time. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Ideally placed to take this out. BAREFOOT ROYALE (2) has missed the frame at his last couple of starts but just a few runs back broke the clock when winning over 390m at this track, taking a Restricted WIN in a powerful 21.62. Expecting another bold showing. DOOGIE MCGRAW (6) goes very well over this track and trip including three wins. Was out of the placings last time (25.59) at Grafton in a Grade 4/5, finishing sixth and beaten 4 lengths. Looks one of the chances. HARA'S GREGOR (8) has strong credentials from this draw.",
